<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Marriott said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Marriott said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette raised the rating on Marriott International Inc to recommend list from market perform, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- shares rose one to 52-5/8.</p>
</text>
